==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Literally “of the old day”, from {{m|is|gamall||old}} + {{m|is|dagur||day}} (genitive ''dags''). Compare {{cog|sv|gammaldags}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|is|adjective|indeclinable}}

# [[old-fashioned]]
#: {{syn|is|úreltur}}
#: {{ux|is|Hann er svo '''gamaldags'''.|He is so '''old-fashioned'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hann notar mörg '''gamaldags''' orð.|He uses many '''old-fashioned''' words.}}

